cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use germquant in your work, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: germquant
abstract: >-
  Reproducible 3D quantification of the C. elegans meiotic germline from confocal .nd2 z-stacks:
  nucleus segmentation (Cellpose), germline isolation, gonad-axis linearization, RAD-51 focus
  counting (SpotMAX) and SYP / PGL-1 colocalization, with tidy per-nucleus tables and provenance.
authors:
  - family-names: Eastman
    given-names: Ryan
    affiliation: "Colorado State University, Cahoon Lab"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-09"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ryan-eastman/C_elegans_germline_masking_and_spot_counting"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - C. elegans
  - germline
  - meiosis
  - RAD-51
  - nucleus segmentation
  - spot counting
  - Cellpose
  - SpotMAX
  - confocal microscopy
